+
+119 automated tests passed, zero failed/skipped. Complete browser creator/input/zoom, real IndexedDB termination, natural two-window update and stopped-origin fresh-document race/edit evidence retained. Fixed score retry, inspector focus, narrow enlarged-text layout and publisher/gate/journal/recovery gaps. Twelve Workshop recreations match authoritative source bytes.
