+The [evidence review](evidence-review.md), [coverage review](coverage-review.md), [reuse decision](reuse.json), [scope corrections](scope-corrections.md) and [append-only observations](progress.md) provide per-requirement decisions and limits. Prior audits are retained without rewriting.
